  "alt": {
    "en": "The readout margin equals four times r and does not depend on b. Restoring r changes the corrupted margin from −4 to 4; restoring b leaves it at −4. Both coordinates nevertheless reveal color in the correlated observational examples.",
    "zh-hans": "输出分差为 r 的四倍，与 b 无关。恢复 r 把扰动分差从 −4 改为 4，恢复 b 后仍为 −4。不过，在相关的观察样例中，两坐标都能读出颜色。"
  },
  "caption": {
    "en": "Figure 28.1 — The matched ineffective patch is evidence too.",
    "zh-hans": "图 28.1：匹配但无效的修补，同样提供证据。"
  },
  "credit": {
